# Readonly managed repository profile
allow read README.md
allow read README.*
allow read AGENTS.md
allow read repo_protocol_standard.yaml
allow read repo_context_index.yaml
allow read round_state/**
allow read docs/index.md
allow read docs/roadmap*.md
allow read docs/architecture*.md
allow read CHANGELOG.md
deny write **
deny read **/.env
deny read **/.env.*
deny read **/*secret*
deny read **/*token*
